{"id":"vod_sn_37158","vodId":"37158","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"urara迷路帖","name_cn":"urara迷路帖","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9a5b2043bb982e5978111168b07fa79a.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个名为“迷路镇”的小镇之中，在这里，居住着很多以占卜为职业的占卜师，他们被称为“Urara”。活泼可爱的少女千矢（原田彩枫 配音）千里迢迢来到迷路镇，她希望能在这里见到一直都在寻找的母亲，在这座拥有着神奇力量，因缘交汇的小镇，千矢的梦想能够化为现实呢？　　出生于名门茶屋的巽绀（本渡枫 配音）、含着金汤匙出生但格外平易近人的千金大小姐雪见小梅（久保由利香 配音）、胆小害羞，擅长操纵人偶的枣乃乃（佳村遥 配音），千矢在迷路镇和这三位可爱的少女相遇了，志同道合的四人一拍即合，共同朝着目的地枣屋进发。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nkdNbW9L711/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1XjHHPhGTv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4gpYxyAB5u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0S3rSGbYBM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/km77pgutcM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vttMSPBisT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WzP8XLy9yd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gim68c61X61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LXSCzTnXFA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ue8Rn6x6iY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4Vi7tXvFy11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MsWxnjj2km1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.420Z"}